# Haraka plugin list. Haraka loads these in order and fires each
# one's hooks during the SMTP conversation.
#
# Minimal stack for an SMTP → HTTP shim:
#   - dnsbl is deliberately OFF. We're not a public MX yet, so
#     DNS blocklists are noise.
#   - spf / dkim_verify are OFF for the same reason. Phase 2+ may
#     enable them when we open to the real internet.
#   - orbital-webhook is our custom plugin that POSTs the message
#     to Laravel at end-of-DATA. It's the only thing that matters.

orbital-webhook
